  "cil_liability": false,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on the 10th August 2026 the use of the main house as a House in Multiple Occupation (Use Class C4) for five occupants at 74 Cranleigh Road, Feltham, TW13 4QB was lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\nThe evidence provided is sufficiently precise and unambiguous to prove, on a balance of probability that the use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation (Use Class C4) commenced prior to the borough wide Article 4 Direction coming into effect and the proposed internal alterations would not be considered Development under Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 nor would they amount to the creation of a separate self-contained unit. \r\n"
  ]
